# Durable LLM budget for the Minime autonomous agent (launchd job
# com.minime.autonomous-agent). Sourced by scripts/launchd_autonomous_agent.sh
# BEFORE the `launchctl getenv` import loop, so precedence is:
#   code default  <  this file (survives reboot)  <  launchctl setenv (operator/canary override)
#
# Why this file exists (2026-10-01): these values had been deployed "config only"
# via `launchctl setenv` (minime CHANGELOG 2026-09-09). The macOS reboot on
# 2026-09-25 13:59 erased them; the agent restarted at 17:49 with the code
# defaults (60 s / gemma3:4b). The source-study budget fell from 853 s to
# 320 s — below the ~340 s a 4096-token answer takes at ~12 tok/s — and 26 of
# her longest studies were discarded mid-generation and replaced by a gemma3:4b
# stub in four days (0 timeouts in the 5,286 calls before the reboot).
#
# fallback == primary collapses the attempt list to the 12B model only
# (runtime._llm_backend_attempts), exactly the proven pre-reboot state.
MINIME_LLM_TIMEOUT_S=160
MINIME_LLM_FALLBACK_TIMEOUT_S=160
MINIME_FALLBACK_MODEL=gemma4:12b
